@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@managerEmail = admin@laprizza.pt
@managerPassword = LaPrizzaAdmin_013DI!
@customerPassword = StrongPassword123!
@fileName = manual.txt

### ==========================================
### 1: AUTENTICAÇÃO E PREPARAÇÃO
### ==========================================

### 1.1 Login do Manager (Seeder)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{managerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{managerPassword}}"
}
?? status == 200

### Extração do Token do Manager
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.accessToken}}

### 1.2 POST Criar Customer (201 Created)
# O email é aleatório para o flow poder correr mais do que uma vez.
# @name createCustomer
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer{{$randomInt 100000 999999}}@laprizza.pt",
  "password": "{{customerPassword}}",
  "role": "CUSTOMER"
}
?? status == 201

### Variáveis
@customerEmail = {{createCustomer.email}}

### 1.3 Login do Customer (200 OK)
# @name loginCustomer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{customerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{customerPassword}}"
}
?? status == 200

### Extração do Token do Customer
@customerToken = {{loginCustomer.accessToken}}

### 1.4 DELETE Limpeza preventiva do ficheiro (204 ou 404 - sem asserção)
# Garante que o 2. cria um ficheiro novo (201) mesmo que uma execução anterior tenha parado a meio.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources/{{fileName}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### ==========================================
### 2: UPLOAD E VALIDAÇÕES (PUT)
### ==========================================

### 2. PUT Upload como Manager, ficheiro novo (201 Created)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources/{{fileName}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

Conteudo de teste
?? status == 201

### 2.1 PUT Upload do mesmo nome, substitui o ficheiro (200 OK)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources/{{fileName}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

Conteudo atualizado
?? status == 200

### 2.2 PUT Extensão não permitida (400 Bad Request)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources/script.exe
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

x
?? status == 400

### 2.3 PUT Upload como Customer (403 Forbidden - apenas Manager)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources/{{fileName}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

Conteudo de teste
?? status == 403


### ==========================================
### 3: LISTAGEM E DOWNLOAD (GET)
### ==========================================

### 3. GET Listar como Customer (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
?? status == 200

### 3.1 GET Listar como Manager (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
?? status == 200

### 4. GET Download como Customer (200 OK - devolve o conteúdo atualizado no 2.1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources/{{fileName}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
?? status == 200

### 4.1 GET Path traversal (400 Bad Request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources/..%2F..%2Fetc%2Fpasswd
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
?? status == 400


### ==========================================
### 5: REMOÇÃO (DELETE)
### ==========================================

### 5. DELETE Como Customer (403 Forbidden - apenas Manager)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources/{{fileName}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
?? status == 403

### 5.1 DELETE Como Manager (204 No Content)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources/{{fileName}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
?? status == 204


### ==========================================
### 6: CONSISTÊNCIA APÓS REMOVER
### ==========================================

### 6. GET Download do ficheiro removido (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources/{{fileName}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
?? status == 404


### ==========================================
### 7: AUTENTICAÇÃO (TOKEN EM FALTA OU INVÁLIDO)
### ==========================================

### 7. GET Listar sem token (401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources
?? status == 401

### 7.1 GET Com token inválido (401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shared-resources
Authorization: Bearer token_invalido
?? status == 401
